    /// - Remark: HTTP `DELETE /v1/storage-locations/{storageLocationId}/items/{itemId}`.
    /// - Remark: Generated from `#/paths//v1/storage-locations/{storageLocationId}/items/{itemId}/delete(removeStorageLocationItem)`.
